      "figmaLine": "page `3284:23179` · set `1149:71305` (Info, Popup, Sign In, Create product, With radio inputs, With timeline, With progress bar, With list, OTP, Share) · header `1149:71403` (7 types) · footer `1149:71444` (4 types) · template `templates/components/Modal.tsx`",
