      "figmaLine": "page `13261:80923` · set `1149:37097` (Default, Navigation, With forms, Advanced, With alert, With list, Bottom, Swipeable) · heading `1149:37184` (8 types) · footer `1149:37232` (4 types × Desktop/Mobile) · template `templates/components/Drawer.tsx`",
