      "figmaLine": "page `3282:18862` · menu `1149:39895` (16 types) · item `1149:39651` (16 types × Initial/Hover/Disabled) · header `1149:39866` (5 types) · triggers `1149:40204` (6 types) · template `templates/components/Dropdown.tsx`",
