      "figmaLine": "page `3279:34616` · sidebar `1149:82628` (Default, With alert, Double sidebar × Contracted) · item `1149:82699` (With icon, With badge × Initial/Hover-Active/Disabled/Collapsed) · header `1149:82737` (Heading, Logo, User select) · template `templates/components/Sidebar.tsx`",
